<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">&lt;Client name&gt;</span>,<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">We are reaching out to inform you of an upcoming satisfaction survey that will be sent to you by. The survey will arrive from <a href="Surveys@insperity.com">Surveys@insperity.com</a>, and we sincerely hope you can participate. Your insights are crucial to us; they enable us to tailor our services to better meet the evolving demands of your business.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">The feedback you provide is not only appreciated but will be directly communicated to our corporate office, ensuring that your experience helps shape our offerings. Should you have any inquiries or need further assistance, please feel free to contact me.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Thank you for your continued partnership and for taking the time to help us improve.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>